https://webhook.site/PASTE-YOUR-COLLECTOR-URL-HERE

Rename this file to report.url to turn log sharing on for this install.

WHAT IT DOES

The mod posts the tail of its own log to the address on the first line, at the
moments a diagnosis wants one: entering a match, beginning a load, any failure,
and shutting down. It exists because every fault worth fixing so far has needed
two or three machines at once, and whoever reads the logs is sitting at none of
them.

WHAT IT SENDS

The log, which at this setting records what the mod is doing in detail. That
includes your Steam name and id, the Steam names and ids of the people in your
session, and what the session was doing at the time. It does not include your
friends list, your messages, or anything belonging to the game itself.

WHAT IT WILL NOT DO

Nothing is sent unless this file exists and holds an https address. There is no
address compiled into the mod, and no credentials, so a build without this file
behaves exactly as though the feature were not there.

While it is on, the status panel says TEST BUILD: SHARING LOGS on this machine,
for as long as it is on.

Whoever set up the address can read what arrives, so use one you are willing to
share with the people you are testing with.

THIS IS TEMPORARY

It is here for the testing period and is meant to be deleted rather than
configured away. Delete this file to stop sharing at any time.
